        <mxCell id="chat-t27" value="Sampled transcripts and thumbs-down answers become candidate benchmark questions (checked against the answer key) → TRAIN misses are the only source for playbook rules and examples → a change ships only if it beats the current config on VAL, then on the sealed TEST split, run once. Stage-1 search: 11 bundles; knowledge (B1) beat compute, cascades, planners and multi-candidate selection at 1/35th of everything-on&#39;s cost." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1A1D23;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="chat-frame25">
